<%- include('partials/header') %>

<!-- Terms & Conditions Hero Banner -->
<div class="page-hero-header" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.82), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85)), url('/images/hotel-img-3.jpg');">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #ffffff;">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Official reservation guidelines and hotel policies for Flutter Hotels & Resorts, Lansdowne.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section-padding" style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 60px 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    
    <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 45px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); color: #334155; line-height: 1.8;">
      <p style="font-size: 15.5px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
        Please ensure that you read all the terms and conditions properly before making a booking with Flutter Hotels & Resorts directly. By completing a reservation, you accept our hotel's norms without any criterion or limitation.
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 15px;"><i class="fas fa-file-contract" style="color: var(--primary-blue);"></i> General Reservation Norms</h3>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">You are making a booking directly with Flutter Hotels & Resorts.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Please review the booking and cancellation policies for the bookings. In case you make a change or cancel the booking, the cancellation penalties specified may apply.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">You may be asked to furnish valid government photo identification proofs (Aadhaar, Passport, Driving License) and form of payment during check-in.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Other inclusions not listed as a part of this booking may be chargeable separately at the property.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 15px;"><i class="fas fa-undo-alt" style="color: #ef4444;"></i> Cancellation Rules</h3>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">If cancellation is done <strong>7 or more days prior to arrival</strong>, then the full amount will be refunded.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">If cancellation is done between <strong>5 - 7 days of arrival</strong>, then <strong>50%</strong> of the booking amount will be charged.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">If cancellation is done <strong>within 5 days of arrival</strong>, then the full amount will be charged.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">If <strong>no show</strong>, then the full amount will be charged.</li>
      </ul>

      <div style="background: #f1f5f9; padding: 20px 25px; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-blue);">
        <h4 style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--dark-bg); font-size: 16px;">Contact Support</h4>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #475569;">
          If you have any questions regarding your reservation or cancellation request, please contact us at:<br>
          Phone: <a href="tel:+918929232740" style="color: var(--primary-blue); font-weight: bold;">+91 89 2923 2740</a> | Email: <a href="mailto:sales@flutterhotel.com" style="color: var(--primary-blue); font-weight: bold;">sales@flutterhotel.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
